        <name>isEmojiPresentation</name>
        <qualifiedname>CharProps::isEmojiPresentation</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Checks if this character should render as emoji by default. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns true for characters that have Emoji_Presentation=Yes in Unicode, meaning they should render as emoji glyphs rather than text glyphs when no emoji variation selector is present.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="return"><para>true if the character has default emoji rendering</para>
</simplesect>
