        <briefdescription>
<para>Checks if this character is a combining character. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns true for characters that modify other characters, including:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Mn (Mark, Nonspacing)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Mc (Mark, Spacing Combining)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Me (Mark, Enclosing)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
